#!/usr/bin/env python3
# filepath: grap
"""
GRAP - Galera Raw Analysis Parser
Next-generation entity-based parser for Galera cluster logs

CHRONOLOGICAL ORDERING LIMITATIONS:
When processing multiple log files, GRAP sorts entities chronologically with 
1-second granularity. Events occurring within the same second across different 
log files cannot be ordered relative to each other, as Galera log timestamps 
typically have 1-second precision. Within individual log files, the original 
line order is preserved for same-timestamp events.

USAGE:
  ./grap single.log                    # Single file (preserves original order)
  ./grap file1.log file2.log file3.log # Multiple files (sorted chronologically)
  ./grap --format=json logs/*.log      # JSON output across multiple files
"""

